                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Louisiana, I want to hear from YOU! Next week, I\u2019ll be hosting town hall meetings across LA-06 to discuss the issues that matter most to our communities. From healthcare and education to jobs and disaster relief, your voice is critical in shaping the future of our district.\n\nCan\u2019t attend in person? Join me LIVE on Instagram @repcleofields_! Let\u2019s work together to build a stronger Louisiana. See you there!",
