                "text": "Over a month ago I stood on the House steps with my fellow Democrats, listening to the stories of people whose lives would be up ended if they lost their Medicaid cover coverage. Today, we\u2019re still fighting to #SaveMedicaid. https://t.co/WfJ0WvVcCX",
