                "text": "This morning I had the pleasure of meeting with members of the leadership team from Lane Regional Medical Center. We discussed Medicaid funding and support for the 340B Drug Pricing Program which aims to make pharmaceuticals more affordable. https://t.co/N1JWmZxnCt",
