                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Most people will be asleep, but I won\u2019t because, Republicans will be trying to cut Medicaid by $880 billion in the dead of the night. At 1 am, I will be in the Rules Committee fighting for Louisiana families. Stay tuned. https://t.co/805TC1u7hG",
