                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s now 1:00am and we won\u2019t sit silent while the rich get tax cuts, but American families lose their healthcare and children go hungry. This is unacceptable. That is why I am standing with my good friend, @rep_jackson to fight for the healthcare of our seniors and children with disabilities. The fight begins now and we are willing to stay up all night to see to it that working families win. #savemedicaid #saveSNAP #saveourchildren #saveourseniors",
