                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to The Advocate for allowing me to write about the importance of protecting Medicaid. I encourage everyone to check out the full article at their website. \n\nI hear your concerns and I\u2019ll never stop fighting for you!\n\nhttps://t.co/gJ6xIgPw1O",
