                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Senate just passed the \u201cBig Ugly Bill\u201d that will take away healthcare benefits for over 11.8 million hard-working Americans and increase the deficit by $3.3 trillion just to give tax breaks to the wealthy.\n\nI just flew back into Washington to vote NO on this \u201cBig Ugly Bill\u201d when it gets to the House floor.",
