                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, I had the chance to visit Southwest LA Primary Healthcare Center, tour the fabrication plant opening in Washington, LA, met with Acadian Medical Center\u2019s team, and had meaningful conversations around economic development.\n\nThank you to all the elected officials of St. Landry Parish for the hard work that you do for our constituents. I will continue to fight just as hard in Washington to make sure you all have the resources and opportunities St. Landry needs to thrive.\n#6thdistrictlisteningtour #LA06",
